      "text": "Four screens replace 57 routes.\nThe extra width on desktop becomes breathing room, not more cards — one centred column, a quiet 232px rail, and nothing competing with the board.\nBrand kept (crimson / amber / navy, Outfit + Manrope); the layout language is what resets."
